A personal knowledge base of IT procedures, configurations, and troubleshooting guides built from hands-on experience across homelabs, internships, and real enterprise environments.

Notes started **September 2023** — this repo is the organized version of everything since.

---

## Structure

| Folder | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| [`Automation`](/Automation) | Scripting basics — Bash, PowerShell, Python |
| [`Hardware`](/Hardware) | Troubleshooting guides for desktops, laptops, printers, and network hardware |
| [`Linux`](/Linux) | CLI, security, and service configuration |
| [`Microsoft`](/Microsoft) | Azure, Entra ID, Intune, and M365 administration |
| [`Networking`](/Networking) | Cisco router, switch, AP, VLAN, and VPN configuration |
| [`Security`](/Security) | Network and Wi-Fi security fundamentals |
| [`Ubiquiti`](/Ubiquiti) | UniFi platform setup, network configuration, and VPN |
| [`Virtual Machines`](/Virtual%20Machines) | VM networking, backup, restore, and security |
| [`Windows`](/Windows) | Active Directory, DHCP, DNS, RDP, Hyper-V, and more |

---

## About

This repo is a living reference I maintain as I work through real-world IT environments. If it's in here, I've actually done it.

---

## Adding Docs

New documents follow the template in [`/Template/TEMPLATE.md`](/Template/TEMPLATE.md).

- Filenames: lowercase with hyphens
- Include **Last Updated** date at the top
- Screenshots go in `/Images`

